# From "Five Questions" (Wave III - Freedom, CD2-4): a companion to the
# Gateway Affirmation, spoken at Focus 12 right before opening awareness to a
# question or to contact. @fixed for the same reason as the Affirmation
# itself -- this is a boundary stated in fixed words, not phrasing to vary.

@segment   channel-restriction
@title     Channel Restriction
@levels    F12
@fixed
@duration  ~40s

say Say in your mind, and say to the farthest areas of your perception.
pause 4
say I open this channel of communication only to those whose knowledge, wisdom, development, and experience are equal or greater than my own.
pause 6
say I restrict such contact and communication to constructive purpose, and reject all other.
pause 6
say I open such channel only when I so consciously desire. At all other times, it will remain closed.
pause 8
